{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a1-practice-1","level":"A1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Alphabet und Aussprache","bn":"বর্ণমালা ও উচ্চারণ"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Schule“ শব্দের „sch“ কেমন শোনায়?","options":["স","চ","শ"],"answer":2,"explanation":"sch = শ: Schule (শুলে)।","id":"a1-practice-1-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„mein“ শব্দের „ei“ কেমন শোনায়?","options":["আই","ঈ","অয়"],"answer":0,"explanation":"ei = আই: mein (মাইন)।","id":"a1-practice-1-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Liebe“ শব্দের „ie“ কেমন শোনায়?","options":["এ","দীর্ঘ ঈ","আই"],"answer":1,"explanation":"ie = দীর্ঘ ঈ: Liebe (লীবে)।","id":"a1-practice-1-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„heute“ শব্দের „eu“ কেমন শোনায়?","options":["এউ","আই","অয়"],"answer":2,"explanation":"eu = অয়: heute (হয়টে)।","id":"a1-practice-1-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"কোন অক্ষরটি ss-এর মতো শোনায়?","options":["ß","ü","ä"],"answer":0,"explanation":"ß = ss-এর মতো, যেমন Straße।","id":"a1-practice-1-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"জার্মান „W“ অক্ষরের নাম কোনটির কাছাকাছি?","options":["ফাউ","ভে","ডাব্লিউ"],"answer":1,"explanation":"W-এর নাম „ভে“, যেমন Wasser।","id":"a1-practice-1-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"জার্মান „V“ অক্ষরের নাম কোনটির কাছাকাছি?","options":["ভি","ভে","ফাউ"],"answer":2,"explanation":"V-এর নাম „ফাউ“, যেমন Vater।","id":"a1-practice-1-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Sport“ শব্দের শুরুর „sp“ কেমন শোনায়?","options":["শ্প","স্প","ফ"],"answer":0,"explanation":"শব্দের শুরুতে sp = শ্প।","id":"a1-practice-1-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Straße“ শব্দের শুরুর „st“ কেমন শোনায়?","options":["ৎস","শ্ট","স্ট"],"answer":1,"explanation":"শব্দের শুরুতে st = শ্ট।","id":"a1-practice-1-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Mädchen“ শব্দে কোন বিশেষ অক্ষর আছে?","options":["ä","ö","ü"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Mädchen = ä।","id":"a1-practice-1-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„schön“ শব্দে কোন বিশেষ অক্ষর আছে?","options":["ß","ö","ä"],"answer":1,"explanation":"schön = ö।","id":"a1-practice-1-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"জার্মান „Z“ অক্ষরের 